    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Read it your way: Includes standalone .epub and .pdf versions!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In the searing light of the far future, one thousand years beyond the fall of Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world ended. The sun itself is dying. Yet among the glowing embers and against all odds, life persists. Welcome to the Eddawielm: An accretion disk formed of the flames of a shattered Solar System, strewn with the tumbling fragments of dead planets, and littered with the defiant remnants of mankind; a new world... with all the old problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pickled gherkins and dead men floating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this collection of mystery, misadventure, romance and horror, workmen swoop along cables high above a teeming city, praying they don\u2019t plummet to their doom, while below them, a young seamstress sees too much and finds herself threatened by the sordid side of city politics. In the shadows of the deeper streets, an ill-fated academic studies a mysterious artefact, a detective investigates a kidnapping, and farmers tending fields of vat-grown flesh contend with the arrival of bodies in their meaty crop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Heroes, villains and ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Far from the city and across the burning sea, in a place of great faith and spiritual enlightenment, an unlucky scoundrel discovers that his fate is sealed when he foolishly crosses a notorious gangster. Meanwhile, an archaeological expedition discovers an ancient tomb-ship, a drifting monument to the sleeping dead, set on its endless voyage centuries earlier. Therein the mortal footsteps echo, and something dreadful stirs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please Note: This product is a digital book, packaged and presented via a game engine. Its interactive elements are limited to book and menu navigation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sample this and other works, including the interactive adventure &quot;The Pilgrimage&quot; in the demo!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Read it your way: Includes standalone .epub and .pdf versions!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In the searing light of the far future, one thousand years beyond the fall of Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world ended. The sun itself is dying. Yet among the glowing embers and against all odds, life persists. Welcome to the Eddawielm: An accretion disk formed of the flames of a shattered Solar System, strewn with the tumbling fragments of dead planets, and littered with the defiant remnants of mankind; a new world... with all the old problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pickled gherkins and dead men floating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this collection of mystery, misadventure, romance and horror, workmen swoop along cables high above a teeming city, praying they don\u2019t plummet to their doom, while below them, a young seamstress sees too much and finds herself threatened by the sordid side of city politics. In the shadows of the deeper streets, an ill-fated academic studies a mysterious artefact, a detective investigates a kidnapping, and farmers tending fields of vat-grown flesh contend with the arrival of bodies in their meaty crop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Heroes, villains and ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Far from the city and across the burning sea, in a place of great faith and spiritual enlightenment, an unlucky scoundrel discovers that his fate is sealed when he foolishly crosses a notorious gangster. Meanwhile, an archaeological expedition discovers an ancient tomb-ship, a drifting monument to the sleeping dead, set on its endless voyage centuries earlier. Therein the mortal footsteps echo, and something dreadful stirs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Please Note: This product is a digital book, packaged and presented via a game engine. Its interactive elements are limited to book and menu navigation.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sample this and other works, including the interactive adventure &quot;The Pilgrimage&quot; in the demo!</strong></p>",
